<!-- The CA1 brief's Word styles: the cross-engine recipe (tools/fb/src/docxxengine.rs) in the face of the typst
     template (FRAP 32(a)(5)(A), Times New Roman) at 14 pt (size 28 half points); Body Text and List Item in 31.4 pt
     line boxes (typst pitch-double, FRAP 32(a)(4) double spacing) with a half-inch indent; quotations and footnotes
     (14 pt too) in 20 pt boxes (typst pitch-single), 14 pt around a quotation and 7 pt after a footnote; the heading
     styles in 20 pt boxes (ca1.lua sets every heading's own spacing; the styles give the outline levels). The page
     setup, sections and footers come from ca1.lua and fb render (docxpass.rs). Twips: 20 x pt. -->
<reference xmlns:w="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/wordprocessingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" base="xengine" size="28" body="628" single="400" indent="720" heading="400" quote="280" note-after="140"/>
